# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Simulate a 127-qubit kicked-Ising model for the latest version of Pauli propagation"
msgstr "Simulasikan model Ising berdenyut 127-qubit untuk versi terkini perambatan Pauli"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Simulate a 127-qubit kicked-Ising model"
msgstr "Simulasikan model Ising berdenyut 127-qubit"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"addons/pauli-prop/guides/simulate-127-q-kicked-ising.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this guide we use the ``pauli-prop`` package to classically simulate the time dynamics of a 127-qubit kicked-Ising model on a heavy-hex lattice and approximate the single-site magnetization, $\\langle Z_{62} \\rangle$. The Hamiltonian considered is:\n"
msgstr "Dalam panduan ini kita menggunakan pakej ``pauli-prop`` untuk mensimulasikan secara klasik dinamik masa bagi model Ising berdenyut 127-qubit pada kekisi heavy-hex dan menganggarkan magnetisasi satu-tapak, $\\langle Z_{62} \\rangle$. Hamiltonian yang dipertimbangkan ialah:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$H = -J\\sum\\limits_{\\langle i,j \\rangle} Z_iZ_j + h\\sum\\limits_iX_i$\n"
msgstr "$H = -J\\sum\\limits_{\\langle i,j \\rangle} Z_iZ_j + h\\sum\\limits_iX_i$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where $J>0$ describes the coupling of nearest-neighbor spins, $i<j$, and $h$ is the global transverse field. A first-order Trotter decomposition of the time-evolved operator will be implemented as a quantum circuit, $U$, over $20$ Trotter steps. The coupling constant, $J$, will be fixed at $J=-\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ such that $U$ is Clifford any time $h\\mod\\frac{\\pi}{2}=0$.\n"
msgstr "dengan $J>0$ menerangkan gandingan spin jiran terdekat, $i<j$, dan $h$ ialah medan melintang global. Penguraian Trotter peringkat pertama bagi pengendali yang berevolusi masa akan dilaksanakan sebagai litar kuantum, $U$, melebihi $20$ langkah Trotter. Pemalar gandingan, $J$, akan ditetapkan pada $J=-\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ supaya $U$ ialah Clifford pada bila-bila masa $h\\mod\\frac{\\pi}{2}=0$.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Workflow:\n"
msgstr "Aliran kerja:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create quantum circuits implementing the Trotterized Ising model\n"
msgstr "Cipta litar kuantum yang melaksanakan model Ising Trotter\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Vary $h$ between Clifford points, $0.0$ and $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$\n"
msgstr "Ubah $h$ antara titik Clifford, $0.0$ dan $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a site in the middle of the lattice (qubit $62$) and estimate the magnetization after $20$ Trotter steps for each circuit\n"
msgstr "Pilih satu tapak di tengah kekisi (qubit $62$) dan anggarkan magnetisasi selepas $20$ langkah Trotter bagi setiap litar\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Observe the magnetization roll off from $1.0$ to $0.0$ as $h$ moves from one Clifford point to another\n"
msgstr "Perhatikan magnetisasi menurun daripada $1.0$ kepada $0.0$ apabila $h$ bergerak dari satu titik Clifford ke titik yang lain\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create circuits {#create-circuits}"
msgstr "Cipta litar {#create-circuits}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, we use ``FakeSherbrooke`` from ``qiskit-ibm-runtime`` to get the edge indices for the coupling map of the 127-qubit Eagle QPU. Once we have the edge indices, we create the Trotter circuits for the varying values of $h$ we want to simulate. The circuits will implement a first-order Trotterization of the Hamiltonian using 20 Trotter steps and 5420 gates.\n"
msgstr "Pertama, kita menggunakan ``FakeSherbrooke`` daripada ``qiskit-ibm-runtime`` untuk mendapatkan indeks tepi bagi peta gandingan QPU Eagle 127-qubit. Setelah kita mempunyai indeks tepi, kita mencipta litar Trotter untuk pelbagai nilai $h$ yang ingin kita simulasikan. Litar tersebut akan melaksanakan Trotterisasi peringkat pertama bagi Hamiltonian menggunakan 20 langkah Trotter dan 5420 gate.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Simulate the time dynamics with Pauli propagation {#simulate-the-time-dynamics-with-pauli-propagation}"
msgstr "Simulasikan dinamik masa dengan perambatan Pauli {#simulate-the-time-dynamics-with-pauli-propagation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, we specify the observable, $O$, we want to measure. In this case, we estimate $\\langle Z_{62} \\rangle$.\n"
msgstr "Seterusnya, kita menentukan observable, $O$, yang ingin kita ukur. Dalam kes ini, kita menganggarkan $\\langle Z_{62} \\rangle$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To study the magnetization between Clifford points, we approximately propagate $O$ to the beginning of the circuit, $U$, resulting in a new observable, $O^\\prime \\approx U^{\\dagger}OU$.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengkaji magnetisasi antara titik Clifford, kita merambatkan $O$ secara anggaran ke permulaan litar, $U$, menghasilkan observable baharu, $O^\\prime \\approx U^{\\dagger}OU$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"During propagation, the number of terms in the evolved observable grows exponentially in the number of gates, so it is usually necessary to limit how large it can grow. Here, we limit the number of terms in $O^\\prime$ to $10^5$ and truncate terms with coefficients smaller than $10^{-5}$. Truncating terms results in some error.\n"
"Once we have $O^\\prime$, we can easily estimate the expectation value, $\\langle0|U^{\\dagger}OU|0\\rangle = \\langle0|O^\\prime|0\\rangle$, by summing the coefficients of the diagonal terms in $O^\\prime$ (terms consisting only of ``I`` or ``Z`` on all qubits).\n"
msgstr ""
"Semasa perambatan, bilangan sebutan dalam observable yang berevolusi bertambah secara eksponen dengan bilangan gate, jadi biasanya perlu mengehadkan seberapa besar ia boleh berkembang. Di sini, kita mengehadkan bilangan sebutan dalam $O^\\prime$ kepada $10^5$ dan memangkas sebutan dengan pekali lebih kecil daripada $10^{-5}$. Pemangkasan sebutan menyebabkan sedikit ralat.\n"
"Setelah kita mempunyai $O^\\prime$, kita boleh menganggarkan nilai jangkaan dengan mudah, $\\langle0|U^{\\dagger}OU|0\\rangle = \\langle0|O^\\prime|0\\rangle$, dengan menjumlahkan pekali sebutan pepenjuru dalam $O^\\prime$ (sebutan yang hanya terdiri daripada ``I`` atau ``Z`` pada semua qubit).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We set ``frame='h'`` to specify we want to evolve the observable in the Heisenberg framework ($U^{\\dagger}OU$). Use ``frame=s`` for Schrödinger evolution ($UOU^{\\dagger}$).\n"
msgstr "Kita menetapkan ``frame='h'`` untuk menentukan bahawa kita ingin mengevolusikan observable dalam rangka kerja Heisenberg ($U^{\\dagger}OU$). Gunakan ``frame=s`` untuk evolusi Schrödinger ($UOU^{\\dagger}$).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visualize {#visualize}"
msgstr "Visualisasi {#visualize}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, we plot the magnetization as a function of $h$. When $h=0$, the circuit does not affect the initial state in the computational basis, and we know $\\langle0|O|0\\rangle = 1.0$. As $h$ moves further from $0$, the magnetization decays monotonically until $h$ reaches the next Clifford angle, $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$, and the magnetization converges to $0$.\n"
msgstr "Akhir sekali, kita memplot magnetisasi sebagai fungsi $h$. Apabila $h=0$, litar tidak menjejaskan keadaan awal dalam asas pengiraan, dan kita tahu $\\langle0|O|0\\rangle = 1.0$. Apabila $h$ bergerak lebih jauh daripada $0$, magnetisasi mereput secara monotonik sehingga $h$ mencapai sudut Clifford seterusnya, $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$, dan magnetisasi menumpu kepada $0$.\n"

